  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now again rewriting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is discontinuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is discontinuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
